## 2. Dependency Supply-Chain Vetting (`SC11`)

1. Add third-party dependencies only when standard library or existing workspace packages cannot solve the problem.
2. Pin versions in the lockfile (`{{lockfile_name}}`) and verify native/runtime permissions before adoption.
3. Run `{{dependency_audit_cmd}}` to check for known security advisories.

